---
import Layout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Jeff Wieland">
  <article>
     <section id="demos" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Demos & Technical Prototypes</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      Public, production-inspired demos showcasing practical implementations of
      privacy-safe programmatic advertising, measurement, and open-web standards.
    </p>

    <div class="demo-list">

      <div class="demo-item">
        <h3>GDPR & Consent Management Demo (Prebid.js)</h3>
        <p>
          A hands-on demonstration of GDPR-compliant consent enforcement using
          Prebid.js Transparency & Consent Framework (TCF) modules.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Implements Prebid TCF Consent Management Module</li>
          <li>Implements Prebid TCF Control Module</li>
          <li>Demonstrates privacy-safe auction behavior under multiple consent scenarios</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="demo-links">
          <a href="https://jdwieland8282.github.io/tcf-demo/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            View Demo →
          </a>
          </br>
          <a href="https://github.com/jdwieland8282/tcf-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            View Repo on GitHub →
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="demo-item">
        <h3>Enrichment Lift Measurement Demo</h3>
        <p>
          Demonstrates how to measure the downstream value of data enrichment
          within real-time programmatic auctions using Prebid.js.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Implements the Prebid Enrichment Lift Measurement Module</li>
          <li>Measures performance impact of enriched vs non-enriched traffic</li>
          <li>Focuses on transparent, privacy-aware measurement techniques</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="demo-links">
          <a href="https://jdwieland8282.github.io/enrichment-lift/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            View Demo  →
          </a>
          </br>
          <a href="https://github.com/jdwieland8282/enrichment-lift" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            View Repo on GitHub →
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

  </article>
</Layout>